# Crash Test -- deliberate faults, for exercising the panic path.
#
# ShowIn=startmenu deliberately: no desktop icon. Every other entry gets
# one, but a single click on this one can end the machine, and an icon
# sitting next to Notepad invites exactly that. It is a diagnostic, so it
# lives where you go looking for it.
#
# The kernel half refuses unless booted with `faultinject` (see
# docs/boot-flags.md); the app shows the buttons either way and says so.
Name=Crash Test
Exec=/bin/wm/demos/crashtest
Category=demos
Icon=!
ShowIn=startmenu
